[{"id":181151602,"discussion_id":"58fea41bc29832465f1fd9eb00b31e280827161e","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `DynamicQuantLargeShapeDb` 在无尾块场景（`innerLoopTail == 0`）下的精度问题。当不存在尾块时，原代码在首轮循环中仅执行 `ComputeMaxScale`，第二轮循环再执行 `ComputeY` 和 `CopyOutY`，导致最后一批数据的量化计算精度不足。修改后，在第一个循环的最后一轮迭代中直接调用 `ComputeMaxScaleAndYTail` 并完成 `CopyOutY`，同时第二个循环跳过该轮，确保无尾块时也能对最后一组元素进行完整的量化计算与输出。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **首轮循环中合并尾块逻辑**：在 `DynamicQuantLargeShapeDb` 的第一个 `innerLoopTimes` 循环中新增 `needFinalInLoop` 判断——当 `innerLoopTail == 0` 且 `innerLoopTimes > 0` 时，最后一轮迭代改用 `ComputeMaxScaleAndYTail` 替代 `ComputeMaxScale`，并追加 `CopyOutY`，确保无尾块场景下最后一批数据获得完整的量化处理。\n- **第二轮循环迭代次数调整**：第二个循环的迭代次数由 `innerLoopTimes` 改为 `yLoopTimes`，当 `needFinalInLoop` 为真时减少一次迭代（`innerLoopTimes - 1`），避免对已在首轮循环中完成输出的最后一组元素重复执行 `ComputeY` 和 `CopyOutY`。\n- **尾块处理分支保持不变**：原有的 `innerLoopTail > 0` 尾块处理分支（调用 `ComputeMaxScaleAndYTail` 与 `CopyOutY`）未做修改，仅在有尾块时触发，改动不影响该路径。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-22T15:29:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-22T15:56:38+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181151606,"discussion_id":"98ca09826cd82d16919fe5adefbc4490ae3857b0","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-22T15:29:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-22T15:58:33+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181151650,"discussion_id":"7108e0ce377dddb7dadf5b587df1125430ed7b0e","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by m